/-!
# Native transports of octads disjoint from the first standard octad

The thirty displayed permutations fix the first standard octad and carry the
second to all octads disjoint from it. Membership in M24 is certified by the
twelve Golay row images; coverage is checked against all 759 native octads.
The tables were found by breadth-first traversal using the native standard
generators. Only the kernel-checked identities below enter the proof.

Source: Aschbacher, *Sporadic Groups*, Chapter 7, §20 (trio geometry).
-/

